      "writtenOn": "2026-09-21T17:22:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s not do this in the first pass, as I believe we want a more generic solution to this that does not involve treating different refs differently. For now, I would just document that this strategy may split refs in the same set across different pushes.\n\nIn order to do this properly, we would need to push any refs in a set (in the same file on disk) together. Do you have a proposal on how we can do that?",
      "revId": "6961c8d41816e28f3437788b0bc497c5ff0fb10f",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
