      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-22T06:14:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dropped, and documented that refs updated together may be split across pushes. Proposal: hash the set of refs from one event off a single member instead of each ref, so anything written together lands in one push without special-casing ref names. The catch is that refsOwnedBy needs placement recomputable from one ref name to dedupe full syncs, so full syncs would keep the per-ref rule.",
      "parentUuid": "b033965f_1d7c35bf",
      "revId": "6961c8d41816e28f3437788b0bc497c5ff0fb10f",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
